1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,669
Tuesday. Four-twelve in the afternoon.

2
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:06,549
One of your cars goes through a toll.

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,560
Nobody pays.

4
00:00:09,159 --> 00:00:10,259
Not yet.

5
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:14,389
Three weeks later, the bill
arrives with your name attached.

6
00:00:16,579 --> 00:00:21,170
By then, the renter is gone,
refunded, and the rental is closed.

7
00:00:22,579 --> 00:00:26,109
So you pay it, calling it
the cost of doing business.

8
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:32,909
The same thing happens with tickets,
fuel, and vehicle damage.

9
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:38,966
But the toll agencies knew.
E-ZPass, SunPass,

10
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:42,270
thirty-one networks in all,
coast to coast.

11
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:45,019
And the booking knew who was driving.

12
00:00:45,059 --> 00:00:50,469
MyEZToll puts those two together and
collects, from the renter's card.

13
00:00:51,259 --> 00:00:55,590
One small fleet. One week.
Four hundred twelve dollars —

14
00:00:55,739 --> 00:00:57,629
and it was going to be yours to swallow.

15
00:00:58,399 --> 00:01:02,269
So what does the platform
actually cost your fleet?

16
00:01:04,379 --> 00:01:08,970
Nothing: no subscription, setup fee,
or charge for each vehicle.

17
00:01:10,279 --> 00:01:14,149
Connecting the GPS you
already use is free as well.

18
00:01:16,779 --> 00:01:21,329
The only paid option is our
own telematics hardware.

19
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:27,849
You pay nothing. The toll comes back to
you in full — plus a share of our fee.

20
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,729
Stop losing. Start earning.
